  message: "UNBLOCKED 2026-09-18: INV-kukiz (isbefore this row) is satisfied in PR #1042 — SCIP locals are dropped, so the 21.2% false cross-file edges that made this arm unsafe to enable persistently are gone (455 -> 0 local-pointing edges on aardvark-dns). The remaining SCIP-arm defects are identity-side, not edge-side: INV-dolud (parity does not hold; being retracted in docs, not fixed) and INV-kutid (per-target moniker collision, 5/756). Neither is an edge falsehood. Not started here."  # 026e
